# Keep the Docker build context lean. The builder runs a fresh `bun install`, so host
# node_modules and build outputs are never needed; `references/` holds multi-GB study clones.
**/node_modules
.git
references
packages/enigma-cli/dist
packages/enigma-cli/dist-bin
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.astro
.dev-home
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
